==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы́-|ступа́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|выступа́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-выступать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|выступа́ть|impf|pf=вы́ступить}}

# to [[project]], to [[protrude]], to [[jut]], to [[jut]] out, to [[come out]], to [[stand out]]
#: {{syn|ru|выдава́ться|выделя́ться}}
# to [[step]] forth, to [[step]] forward
# to [[set out]], to [[march]] off
#: {{syn|ru|отправля́ться|вы́ходить}}
# to [[appear]] on the [[surface]]
#: {{syn|ru|проступа́ть|появля́ться}}
# to [[strut]]
# to [[speak]] in public, to [[perform]] ''on stage''
# to [[advocate]] for
# {{lb|ru|dated}} to [[pace]] [[slowly]]
#: {{syn|ru|выша́гивать}}

